         <component>
            <section ID="id_link_4e47c91a-f51f-41fe-e063-6294a90ad9db">
               <id root="4e47c91a-f51e-41fe-e063-6294a90ad9db"/>
               <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
               <title>Directions: Use as Directed</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <br/>
This prescription dentifrice is recommended
  <br/>
for adults and pediatric patients six years and
  <br/>
older.
  <br/>
• Apply a thin ribbon of PRO-SYS Professional
  <br/>
along the length of the toothbrush no more
  <br/>
than "pea size" total dose. Brush for two
  <br/>
minutes.
  <br/>
• After brushing: ADULTS-Expectorate; do not
  <br/>
eat or drink for 30 minutes. CHILDREN SIX
  <br/>
YEARS OF AGE OR OLDER-Expectorate and
  <br/>
rinse mouth with water.
  <br/>
• Use at bedtime in place of your regular
  <br/>
toothpaste or as directed by your dental
  <br/>
professional.
  <br/>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20251201"/>
            </section>
